{"type":"text","timestamp":1791297603071,"sessionID":"ses_eee5985d5ffeNUN2KqbWLcsTV3","part":{"id":"prt_111a83d940019Wrd3pHon5IftR","messageID":"msg_111a83a4e00112PFKcPzSerT3M","sessionID":"ses_eee5985d5ffeNUN2KqbWLcsTV3","type":"text","text":"All 6 visible tests pass, plus documented edge-case checks. Bugs fixed:\n\n1. `ledger/money.py` — `format_cents`: negative amounts produced `-4.90`-style output because floor division/modulo break on negatives; now normalizes with `abs()` so `-$3.10` / `-$0.05` render correctly.\n2. `ledger/parse.py` — `parse_date`: returned `(y, d, m)`; day and month were swapped. Now returns `(year, month, day)`.\n3. `ledger/report.py` — `top_items`: sorted totals ascending with no tie-break, returning the smallest items. Now sorts by total descending, ties broken by item name ascending, as the docstring requires.","time":{"start":1791297600916,"end":1791297603065}}}
